sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Usuario
    participant Lab as FactoryLabPage<br/>polling 2.5s
    participant Factory as FactoryServer<br/>17680
    participant Store as WorkItemStore<br/>reviewCount
    participant ImplSvc as ImplementService<br/>handleBuilding
    participant Writer as ResultWriter<br/>result.json
    participant RevSvc as ReviewService<br/>handleReview
    participant Selector as ReviewModelSelector<br/>pares+fallback
    participant Agent as ReviewAgent<br/>read-only tools
    participant OpMgr as OpencodeServerManager<br/>efimero
    participant Disk as review.json<br/>disco atomico
    participant FLog as ForemanLogStore<br/>timeline+logs

    Note over ImplSvc,Writer: Building ya termino con pass (Ola 3)
    ImplSvc->>Writer: write(dir, payload pass) result.json tmp-renombrado
    ImplSvc->>Store: transition(Building → Review, actor runner, msg verification passed → review)
    Store-->>ImplSvc: WorkItem Review reviewCount=0
    ImplSvc->>FLog: info [Implement] job-x → Review (pass, dispara revision)
    ImplSvc->>RevSvc: handleReview(workItem) async post-transition (fire-and-forget)
    RevSvc->>Store: acquireReviewLock(job-x) true
    RevSvc->>Selector: selectReviewer(implementModel)
    alt mismo modelo (igual provider/model)
        Selector-->>RevSvc: SAME_MODEL block
        RevSvc->>Store: appendEvent Review ask_human mismo-modelo-bloqueado
        RevSvc->>FLog: warn [Review] job-x ask_human mismo modelo implement==reviewer
        RevSvc->>Store: releaseReviewLock(job-x)
    else modelos distintos
        Selector-->>RevSvc: reviewerModel (par o fallback)
        RevSvc->>Store: appendEvent review:started reviewer=X attempt=N
        RevSvc->>Agent: consume({prompt original, createdFiles, verification, diff}, reviewerModel)
        Agent->>OpMgr: getClient() reusa efimero
        Agent->>Agent: buildReviewPrompt(input) 4000 + diff + result.json
        Agent->>OpMgr: session.create({title: Review job-x, directory: worktree})
        OpMgr-->>Agent: sessionId ses_rev_abc
        Agent->>OpMgr: session.prompt({model: reviewerModel, tools:{read,glob,grep}, json_schema})
        Note over OpMgr: LLM solo-lectura<br/>read createdFiles, grep secretos,<br/>glob tests/** — NO write/edit
        OpMgr-->>Agent: JSON {verdict, findings[3 ejes], summary, confidence}
        Agent->>Agent: parseReviewResponse(raw) zod strict + robustExtract
        Agent-->>RevSvc: ReviewResult {verdict, findings, confidence}
        RevSvc->>Disk: writeReview(dir, result) review.json tmp-rename
        RevSvc->>Store: appendEvent review:verdict verdict=X findings=N
        RevSvc->>FLog: decision/warn [Review] job-x → verdict X
        alt verdict accept
            RevSvc->>Store: transitionWithReview(Review → Complete, result)
            RevSvc->>Disk: ensure .done existe
            RevSvc->>FLog: info [Review] job-x → Complete (accept)
        else verdict revise AND reviewCount < 2
            RevSvc->>Store: incrementReviewCount(job-x) → 1 o 2
            RevSvc->>Store: transitionWithReview(Review → Building, result, msg findings para rebuild)
            RevSvc->>FLog: warn [Review] job-x → Building (revise N/2)
            Note over ImplSvc: Building re-ejecuta ImplementAgent con findings en prompt<br/>al terminar pass vuelve a Review (attempt+1)
        else verdict revise AND reviewCount >= 2
            RevSvc->>Store: appendEvent Review ask_human max-revisiones-2-alcanzado (SIN transicion)
            RevSvc->>FLog: warn [Review] job-x ask_human max 2 revisiones
            Note over Lab: queda en Review esperando humano
        else verdict ask_human
            RevSvc->>Store: appendEvent Review ask_human reason (SIN transicion)
            RevSvc->>FLog: warn [Review] job-x ask_human + summary
            Note over Lab: queda en Review esperando humano
        end
        RevSvc->>Store: releaseReviewLock(job-x)
    end

    par Polling visible sin reload
        Lab->>Factory: GET /factory/jobs cada 2.5s
        Factory->>Store: list() con lastReview + reviewCount + verdict
        Store-->>Factory: WorkItem[] Review/Complete/Building
        Factory-->>Lab: 200 jobs + reviewPreview + timeline
        Lab->>Lab: FlowBar Review activo + badge accept/revise/ask_human + ReviewPanel findings
        Lab->>Factory: GET /foreman/logs?limit=100 cada 2.5s
        Factory-->>Lab: logs [Review] verdict + findings
    end
